{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, everybody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pakistan's prime minister\njust announced a cease fire, effective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7833,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "immediately between the US and Israel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11233,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the one hand,\nand Iran on the other hand, which should."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14366,
    "dDurationMs": 5134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Open the Strait of Hormuz\nfor a corresponding period of two weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19500,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So does this mean that\nthe global economic meltdown is canceled?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24100,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's talk about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25233,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, by going into\nwhat's happening with the three"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28600,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "major economic crises\nthat the war has set in motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33166,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have the energy\ncrisis, the fertilizer and food crisis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37366,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the emerging market\ncurrency crisis, such as the Indian rupee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42866,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then after that, we will talk about peace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46066,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How likely will the ceasefire\nhold up and lead to peace?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50266,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But before getting into both, here's\na quick update on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53766,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59021,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "official statement\nfrom Iran's Minister of Foreign Affairs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63054,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on behalf of the Islamic Republic of Iran,\nI express gratitude and appreciation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69021,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for Pakistan for their tireless efforts\nto end the war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72787,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in response to their tweet\nand considering the request of the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76954,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for negotiations\nbased on its 15 point proposal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81021,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as announcement by voters\nabout acceptance of the general framework"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84854,
    "dDurationMs": 5267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Iran's ten point proposal\nas a basis for negotiations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90121,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91221,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hereby declare, on behalf of Iran's\nSupreme National Security Council,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95121,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if attacks against Iran are halted,\nour powerful armed forces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100021,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will cease their defensive operations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103787,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a period of two weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106621,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Safe passage, very important\nthrough the Strait of Hormuz,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110621,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be possible\nvia coordination with Iran's armed forces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114254,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and with due consideration\nof technical limitations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118387,
    "dDurationMs": 867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meaning that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119254,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, \nthese ships do have to talk to the Iranian"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123621,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "army, pay $2 million and so forth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127221,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is not super easy,\nbut they are committed to doing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130854,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then here is Trump's\nresponse on Truth Social."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134287,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Based on conversations\nwith the Prime Minister of Pakistan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137954,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the Islamic Republic of Iran\nagreeing to complete"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141921,
    "dDurationMs": 4866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "immediate and safe\nopening of the Strait of Hormuz, I agree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146787,
    "dDurationMs": 5667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to suspend the bombing and attack of Iran\nfor a period of two weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152454,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason for doing this\nis that we have already met and exceeded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156554,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all military objectives and are very far,\nalong with a definitive agreement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161121,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "concerning long time peace\nwith Iran and peace in the Middle East."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166954,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We received a ten point proposal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169687,
    "dDurationMs": 1034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There we have it again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170721,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from Iran, and I believe it's a workable\nbasis on which to negotiate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175187,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Almost all of the various past\npoints of contention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178054,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have been agreed\nto between the US and Iran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182354,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but a two week period\nwill allow the agreement to be finalized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185954,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and consummated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187954,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on behalf of the United States\nas president"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190187,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also representing the countries\nin the Middle East."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192354,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an honor to have this long\nterm problem close to resolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197387,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in summary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199054,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Duration of the deal 14 day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201587,
    "dDurationMs": 5167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suspension of all military operations\nstarting today, 8th April."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206754,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immediate\nreopening of the Strait of Hormuz"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209554,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for civilian,\nof course, and commercial vessels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213154,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But under Iranian military coordination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216654,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Formal negotiations to begin in Islamabad,\nPakistan, Friday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221221,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This Friday, April 10th."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222454,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The U.S. commits to suspension of strikes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224554,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on Iranian infrastructure\nand civilian targets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227621,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Iranians cessation of retaliatory\ndrone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230987,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and missile attacks, and the maritime\nblockade of the Strait of Hormuz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234854,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This all is verified, as you've just seen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237721,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there are some disagreements as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239721,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to Iran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241587,
    "dDurationMs": 4334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Operations in Lebanon\nby Israel are part of this agreement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245921,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Israel has said that's not the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247821,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what really jumped out to me\nin both of these communications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251554,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they both said that Iran and Trump,\nthe US has their 15 point plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256054,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's secret."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257554,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Iran has a ten point plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259654,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that plan is the basis\nfor the negotiations, not the US plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265354,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what is this plan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266754,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is this ten point plan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268287,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the Iranian embassy in India\nhad this to say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272187,
    "dDurationMs": 7334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They said you started this war, but\nIran will set the conditions for its ends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279954,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That conditions are specifically\nand the US has accepted them as a workable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284987,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "non-aggression zone,\na commitment to no more attacks by the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289254,
    "dDurationMs": 5767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Israel, continuation of Iran's control\nover the Strait of Hormuz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295587,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Acceptance of enrichment of uranium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299621,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lifting of all sanctions, both primary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304054,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that is against Iran\ndirectly and secondary, that is against,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308354,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example, European companies\nthat do business with Iran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311321,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or Chinese companies\nthat do business with Iran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313187,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Termination of all U.N."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314587,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "security resolutions against Iran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316621,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Determination of all International Atomic\nAgency resolutions that have sort of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322021,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "condemned Iran for being too secretive\nwith their uranium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326221,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "payment of compensation to Iran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330387,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So far, at least looking to be in the form\nof these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333687,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$2 million per ship\ngoing through the Strait of Hormuz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336687,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But maybe there will be more very crucial\nwithdrawal of US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341487,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "combat forces from the entire region,\nthe entire Middle East, cessation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346887,
    "dDurationMs": 3234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the war on all fronts, including"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350121,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against the Islamic resistance of Lebanon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353721,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, yeah, obviously both\nparties are claiming victory, Trump said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357754,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah,\nwe have achieved all of our objectives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359854,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran said, you started the war,\nbut we are setting the conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362754,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we are in the driver's seat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364654,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365154,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have my opinions on who clearly looks\nto be in control of the negotiations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369421,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But honestly,\nI think most of the world can now agree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373121,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we should just say whatever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376321,
    "dDurationMs": 1166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, you both won."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377487,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378187,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stop killing people and let's get energy\nand food prices back down, please."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382154,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383521,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But will that actually happen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385221,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's have a look at the."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386621,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Economic impact so far."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388554,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most importantly, when it comes to energy,\nnot all markets are open right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392987,
    "dDurationMs": 300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393287,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "financial markets are actually open,\nbut the ones that are show a clear trend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397754,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here you see the price of Brent crude\nin blue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401621,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having gone up a lot\nsince the war and also at the same time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406054,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "WTI crude which stands for West"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409087,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas Intermediate crude, the US index."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412921,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they have both gone up by quite a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415721,
    "dDurationMs": 5466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But since the announcement\nthey have gone down quite a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421687,
    "dDurationMs": 6767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, clearly still quite a bit\nabove before the war levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428454,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually if we look at, for example,\ndiesel prices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432021,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the Deutsche average,\nwe see the same trend, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435487,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So massively going up after the war\nand then going down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439721,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a little bit now after this announcement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443754,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And same is true for gasoline,\nfor your car and kerosene for airplanes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448587,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which, by the way, it means that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449787,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will probably take a couple of days\nor even 1 or 2 weeks before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453687,
    "dDurationMs": 4534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prices at the pump will go back to, well,\nnot normal, but a bit lower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458387,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since they still have a lot of inventory\nthat was very expensive to buy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463087,
    "dDurationMs": 4234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, let's have a look at the Dutch\nNatural Gas Price Index, which is a proxy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467321,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for Europe, which is a proxy for Asia\nwhere the markets were not open yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471521,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Americans have luckily so far mostly\nbeen spared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475454,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's have a look at European\ngas prices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477654,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which when the Strait of Hormuz closed,\nthey shut up by quite a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481787,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then remained somewhat stable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483454,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now you can clearly see that\nthey have gone down quite a bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488854,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but again, not at all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492087,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the nice level that they were before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495854,
    "dDurationMs": 367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496221,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it comes to fertilizer prices,\nvery important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499054,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What matters most is the so called urea,\nwhich is a type of fertilizer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502954,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Future prices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504121,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the time of recording,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505654,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these were not yet updated\nbecause the markets were closed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508954,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So have a look yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510354,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I expect the same pattern\nto hold a slight drop in prices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514754,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the same goes for currencies of major\nemerging market economies like India,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519487,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pakistan, Bangladesh and the Philippines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523221,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These currencies went down by a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526354,
    "dDurationMs": 5067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because fuel import prices\nfrom the Middle East went up by a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531421,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they had to buy dollars to get them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534254,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the same time,\nthey were getting a lot of money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537221,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from workers\nworking there in the Middle East."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540687,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that money went down by a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543787,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then at the same time,\nglobal interest rates were either going up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547821,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or not going down by as much as expected,\nbecause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551921,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "central banks all over\nthe world were expecting inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555221,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this made it much more difficult,\nor at least more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558821,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "costly to borrow money for countries\nlike India."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562221,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So looking at the Indian rupee,\nfor example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564687,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right after the war,\nit went down by quite a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568621,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then yes,\nit went up back a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572221,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but most crucially\nit went up a little bit already today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576121,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as you can clearly see,\nthis is really not yet a return to normal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581154,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The crisis is not over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582921,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that, I think, is a good summary\nfor all of these crises."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586087,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are my two takeaways one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587854,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, the ceasefire is great news\nfor the global economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590354,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can already see it in prices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592387,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has slowed down the three major\neconomic crises that the world was facing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597021,
    "dDurationMs": 4466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But just as it took a few days before end,\nuse of gas, fuel and food fell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601487,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The impact of the start of the war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602954,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will now take a while\nbefore you feel slightly lower prices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606454,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which brings us to takeaway number two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608221,
    "dDurationMs": 4766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite ships starting to go back through\nthe Strait of Hormuz, prices will remain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612987,
    "dDurationMs": 5334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "higher than they were for weeks,\nif not months for at least four reasons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618321,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reason number one, insurance\npremiums on ships going in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622321,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and out of the Gulf\nwill likely remain pretty high,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626254,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making it less interesting\nto go in and out of the Gulf"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629921,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because ships are unsure\nif they can actually get out again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634321,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Reason number two ships are very,\nvery, very, very slow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639121,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even if shipping fully resumes,\nit will take days for shortages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643521,
    "dDurationMs": 1566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get better. In Asia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645087,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then reason number three,\nthe war has damaged production"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649054,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capacity in many,\nmany of the Gulf countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652021,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we will feel this in energy prices\nfor quite a while longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655721,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then reason a number for countries\nall across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659087,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world will likely start hoarding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662354,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crucial products from the Gulf\nfor a while To prevent another."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666254,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Massive crisis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667954,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the Strait of Hormuz closes again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669921,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, while this ceasefire is\ngreat news, the only real way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674121,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of the global\neconomic crisis is peace, not a ceasefire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678721,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So. Is peace plausible?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680921,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How likely is peace?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682554,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that is $1 billion question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684421,
    "dDurationMs": 933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's be honest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685354,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the problem we have been facing so far\nis that nobody really knows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690421,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even the best geopolitical experts\ndo not know what exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694254,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been discussed between the Foreign\nMinister of Iran, President of Pakistan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698187,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and representatives of the US\nand of course, the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701854,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "President Trump has a fairly unorthodox\nnegotiation style, to say the least."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707554,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what these experts did mostly agree\non, though, is that this ceasefire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710687,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "looks very fragile, mostly due to Israel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714421,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, Iran has said that part\nof the ceasefire agreement was that Israel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718221,
    "dDurationMs": 3666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stops its invasion of Lebanon,\nand Israel has already contradicted that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722254,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if we forget about that for now\nand just focus on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725187,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a potential peace agreement,\nhow far apart are the two sides?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729654,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually,\nlet's go back to the Iranian demands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733454,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How likely are they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735154,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way I see it,\nthere are three major pain points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738321,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is non-aggression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740821,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is, how credible\ncan the US really make it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744154,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they will definitely not attack\nagain, given that they have an armada"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747687,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can just sail all over the world\nwith their airplanes and missiles?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751787,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the second one is withdrawal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755287,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all US forces from the region,\nwhich many analysts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760821,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think that no U.S government\nwould ever do, although perhaps Trump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764554,
    "dDurationMs": 667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765221,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then third, I think\nthis is the most tricky one cessation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769054,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of war on all fronts, including\nagainst the resistance in Lebanon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773421,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which of course means that Israel\nhas to stick to the deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776421,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, the US's 15 point\nplan is confidential, but details"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781154,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that appeared in Israeli newspapers\nsuggest that they include the following."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785754,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran must dismantle its existing\nnuclear capabilities, commit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791054,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to never pursue nuclear weapons,\nwhich again, we'll be committing to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795387,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That like that will be very tricky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798021,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just have to trust them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799554,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There will be no uranium enrichment,\nwhich already clashes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804221,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the Iranian demand\nfor uranium enrichment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808287,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran must hand its stockpile of uranium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812154,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the International Atomic Energy Agency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814554,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nuclear facilities must be dismantled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816721,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran must abandon its regional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820021,
    "dDurationMs": 4766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "proxy paradigm, referring to the groups\nlike the Houthis in Yemen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825154,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Hezbollah\nin Lebanon and various militias in Iraq."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829621,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Relates to that sees the funding\nof these regional proxies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834321,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Strait of Hormuz, must remain open\nand function as a free maritime"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838654,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "corridor, which seems to clash\nwith Iran's demand for controlling it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841821,
    "dDurationMs": 4366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran's missile program must be limited\nin both range and quantity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846221,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And any future use of missiles\nwould be restricted to self-defense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852187,
    "dDurationMs": 467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852654,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "return, Iran would\nbenefit by a full lifting of sanctions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856521,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that is actually the same\nthat Iran once the U.S."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859654,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would assist Iran\nin advancing its civilian nuclear program."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863421,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there perhaps they could both claim\na win that that is what they wanted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867487,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all along. Supposedly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868721,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the so-called snapback mechanism,\nwhich"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871887,
    "dDurationMs": 3234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allows for the automatic\nreimposition of sanctions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875121,
    "dDurationMs": 4666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So sanctions come into place immediately\nafter Iran fails to comply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879787,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be removed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881654,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as we already saw there,\nthere is actually some overlap between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885221,
    "dDurationMs": 766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these demands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885987,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Iran could claim victory\non its civilian nuclear program."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889321,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the same time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890521,
    "dDurationMs": 4366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trump could claim that they have abandoned\ntheir nuclear bomb ambitions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895287,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The proxy system\nvery importantly meaning that Iran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898021,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "supported militias\nlike the Houthis and Hezbollah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901021,
    "dDurationMs": 4366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to my interview with us, Iranian\nProfessor Nasser on money macro talks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905387,
    "dDurationMs": 4734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go check it out was a largely\nfor the during the US and Israel, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910121,
    "dDurationMs": 4533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with its control of the Strait of Hormuz,\nIran now has a much stronger deterrence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914654,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that may help to convince them that\nthe proxies are really no longer need it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919887,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only thing that seems super unlikely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922787,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the US retreats from or basis,\nat least according to most experts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927121,
    "dDurationMs": 4766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but actually, Trump could credibly claim\nthat this is what he wanted all along,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932087,
    "dDurationMs": 4234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it was a core part of his 2025\nnational security strategy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936787,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to this document,\nhis administration wanted to focus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939921,
    "dDurationMs": 5366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the Americas and, to a lesser\nextent, China, not the Middle East."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945287,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in theory, the US and Iran are actually\nless far apart than you may think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951321,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, that does not account for Israel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953721,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Israel seems to want to simply\nthat all their regional rivals end up like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958087,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lebanon, Libya, Iraq and Syria,\na shadow of themselves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962387,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no longer able to threaten Israel\nin any way, shape or form,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966254,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if that means that they are stuck\nin a brutal state of civil war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970254,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it seems in Israel's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973354,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "best interests\nto quite literally blow up this deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976521,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, we'll have to see, won't we?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979621,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980721,
    "dDurationMs": 2066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will Trump and Iran seal the deal?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982787,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will Israel spoil the party?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984987,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know in the comments below."
    } ]
  }, {
